<div class="content">
    <h1>Paid Events Enabled!</h1>

    <p>Hello {{ownerName}},</p>

    <p>
        Exciting news! <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> has been approved to create and host paid events on
        Orgatick.
    </p>

    <!-- Success Banner -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #004aad 0%, #002f6c 100%); border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <img width="64" height="64"
                    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/rocket.png" alt="launch"
                    class="dark-mode-safe"
                    style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px;" />
                <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    Ready to Monetize Your Events!
                </h3>
                <p style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0;">
                    Start earning revenue from your events today
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>
        This is a significant milestone for your organization. You can now create paid events, sell tickets, and
        receive payments directly through the Orgatick platform.
    </p>

    <!-- Unlocked Features -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; background-color: #f0f7ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: center;">
                    ✨ Paid Events Features
                </h3>
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
                    style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/pricing.png"
                                alt="pricing" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Set
                                flexible ticket pricing tiers</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/payment-gateway.png"
                                alt="payment" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Secure
                                payment processing</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/dashboard.png"
                                alt="dashboard" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Real-time
                                revenue tracking</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/auto-payout.png"
                                alt="payout" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Automated
                                payout scheduling</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
                            <img width="24" height="24"
                                src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/niyojan-org/email-assets/icons/lineal/discount.png"
                                alt="promo" class="dark-mode-safe"
                                style="-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; color: transparent; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
                            <span
                                style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle;">Create
                                promo codes and discounts</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    {{> button
    url=createPaidEventUrl
    label="Create Your First Paid Event"
    variant="primary"
    fullWidth=true
    marginTop="20px"
    marginBottom="20px"
    }}

    <!-- Getting Started -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #004aad; padding-left: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    Getting Started:
                </h3>
                <ol style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Create a new event or edit an existing one</li>
                    <li>Set up ticket pricing and availability</li>
                    <li>Configure payment and refund policies</li>
                    <li>Publish your event and start selling!</li>
                </ol>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #ecfdf5; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Pricing & Fees:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0;">
                    Review our transparent fee structure and payout terms in your organization settings. We believe
                    in fair pricing that helps your events succeed.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="">
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0;">
                    Congratulations on this business milestone! We're excited to see your events thrive.
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
                    Best regards,<br />
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">- Orgatick Team</strong>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
